# Server & Slurm

Do not run heavy preprocessing or training on the login node. Use Slurm with CUDA env `mi_torch_cu118`. Smoke-test on a GPU node before full runs. GPU jobs must fail fast if CUDA is unavailable. Keep outputs under this project and never overwrite completed `*_v1` outputs.

Use `python code/run.py --config code/configs/experiments/<phase>.yaml` as the documented entry for new runs.
